like mitosis, for instance.

39
00:02:09,860 --> 00:02:15,200
Also, as eukaryotes, fungi
contain the larger ADS

40
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:19,120
ribosome as compared to
the prokaryotic 70S form.

41
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:21,360
But the two key
differences between

42
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:24,000
