require stabilization.

49
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:47,780
Animal cells are going
to use cholesterol,

50
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:52,260
sterol, to do this, and
that's similar to fungi

51
00:02:52,260 --> 00:02:55,960
that use a different
