96
00:05:28,620 --> 00:05:31,420
Certainly in the medical
field, fungi produce

97
00:05:31,420 --> 00:05:33,700
different types of
drugs like antibiotics.

98
00:05:34,140 --> 00:05:37,060
And of course, a fungus
brought us the first antibiotic

99
00:05:37,060 --> 00:05:40,500
that was ever discovered,
penicillin, which was

100
00:05:40,500 --> 00:05:43,640
