105
00:06:00,460 --> 00:06:04,640
Okay, so systemic fungal
infections are more or less

106
00:06:04,640 --> 00:06:07,460
uncommon, which is mostly
due to the preferred

107
00:06:07,460 --> 00:06:10,800
growth parameters of fungi
that we just mentioned that

108
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:14,820
keeps most infections
superficial but this is also

109
00:06:14,820 --> 00:06:17,820
due to our natural immunity
to fungal infections

110
00:06:17,820 --> 00:06:22,860
so our innate immune
barriers like the skin mucous

111
00:06:22,860 --> 00:06:26,600
membranes and phagocytosis
along with cell mediated

112
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:29,880
immunity which happens to
play a very important part

113
00:06:29,880 --> 00:06:33,300
