both constitute a pretty

114
00:06:33,300 --> 00:06:36,460
formidable barrier to
systemic spread of fungal

115
00:06:36,460 --> 00:06:39,280
infections beyond anything
that would be superficial

116
00:06:40,070 --> 00:06:44,200
so if there is a fungal
infection, it usually indicates

117
00:06:44,200 --> 00:06:46,880
that there's some
underlying issue or problem.

118
00:06:46,980 --> 00:06:50,880
And when there's a systemic
infection, oftentimes it's

119
00:06:50,880 --> 00:06:54,340
difficult to treat because
fungal cells are eukaryotic

120
00:06:54,340 --> 00:06:57,000
and they're so similar
