121
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:59,940
selective toxicity of therapies
is going to be somewhat

122
00:06:59,940 --> 00:07:03,380
low and oftentimes leads to
a number of side effects.

123
00:07:03,780 --> 00:07:07,900
Now over the recent past,
the past few decades, we've

124
00:07:07,900 --> 00:07:11,520
seen a rise in fungal
infections, which is mostly due

125
00:07:11,520 --> 00:07:15,120
to the progression of the
medical field. Over that

126
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:19,520
time, there's been far more
immunosuppressed patients in

127
00:07:19,520 --> 00:07:23,360
an effort to extend the life
