130
00:07:32,960 --> 00:07:35,680
devices, an increased
use of medical devices

131
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:38,260
like catheters and
other implanted devices.

132
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:41,280
Now when a fungus attempts to

133
00:07:41,280 --> 00:07:43,520
establish a systemic infection,

134
00:07:43,780 --> 00:07:47,280
it usually requires a
relatively large dose of

135
00:07:47,280 --> 00:07:51,540
the spores, which are known
