152
00:08:46,710 --> 00:08:49,540
Now, as I mentioned, most
of these infections will be

153
00:08:49,540 --> 00:08:53,920
self-limiting and generally
asymptomatic, but in some

154
00:08:53,920 --> 00:08:57,100
individuals, disseminated
disease can develop where

155
00:08:57,100 --> 00:08:59,940
other sites and organs in
the body become involved,

156
00:08:59,940 --> 00:09:03,300
