180
00:10:26,180 --> 00:10:28,300
They're very light
and can be carried

181
00:10:28,300 --> 00:10:30,820
by the wind so
inhalation is relatively

182
00:10:30,820 --> 00:10:33,380
easy and they're
also very infectious.

183
00:10:33,580 --> 00:10:37,160
Now in the environment
cycles of drought followed by

184
00:10:37,160 --> 00:10:40,940
heavy rain promote the
dispersion and transmission of

185
00:10:40,940 --> 00:10:45,420
the organism because moisture
allows the fungus to thrive

186
00:10:45,420 --> 00:10:49,380
and proliferate in the soil
and then subsequent hot

187
00:10:49,380 --> 00:10:53,180
