188
00:10:53,180 --> 00:10:56,400
the spores making them
relatively easy to inhale.

189
00:10:57,060 --> 00:11:00,320
Now as I mentioned before
they're dimorphic and

190
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:01,720
they're going to grow
differently at higher

191
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:05,320
