-mediated immune response to

193
00:11:08,400 --> 00:11:10,480
the fungus that's going
to restrict its growth.

194
00:11:10,620 --> 00:11:13,720
The primary infection
is in the lungs and it's

195
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:17,280
usually asymptomatic and in
fact most people living in

196
00:11:17,280 --> 00:11:19,500
